# party.pdl - which RPG Maker MV monster picture (character sheet Monster.png: 8 monsters, 3 walk frames x 4 directions each; index = col + 4*row) each DB pet wears.
# The pets themselves are RPG Maker DB entries: &.widgits/db-hq/data/system.pdl (SYSTEM PetParty member1..6) and actors.pdl (ACTOR rows: name, nickname, profile, mhp, mmp, atk, def, mat, mdf, agi, luk).
# The DB actor field "character" is empty today; when it is filled (sheet + index) it wins over this file. This file is only the picture choice, never the data.
# The PERSON (Actor1 sheet) is the trainer and lives in the village, same setup as @.apps/pet-trainer (village not built in rpg-pet yet).
# PET | actor name | sheet | index
PET | Pochi | Monster | 1
PET | Momo  | Monster | 0
